### Feature Session: perfil/permisos (JWT) y logout (OPEN con refresh token)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginComercial
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "comercial",
  "password": "Comercial123!"
}

### Perfil propio con avatar y estado; no contiene password
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComercial.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Permisos efectivos del usuario autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/permisos
Authorization: Bearer {{loginComercial.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Sin access token: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/perfil

### Logout idempotente (OPEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{loginComercial.response.body.$.refresh_token}}"
}

### El refresh revocado ya no se puede renovar: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{loginComercial.response.body.$.refresh_token}}"
}